# TMDB logo attribution

This is the approved short blue TMDB logo asset, sourced from the official approved-logo page:
https://www.themoviedb.org/about/logos-attribution

Original SVG URL:
https://www.themoviedb.org/assets/v4/logos/v2/blue_short-8e7b30f73a4020692ccca9c88bafe5dcb6f8a62a4c6bc55cd9ba82bb2cd95f6c.svg

Do not change the approved logo's colors, aspect ratio, orientation, or proportions. Its use must not imply endorsement, certification, or approval by TMDB. The logo is shown smaller than the ReiAnix name in the About/Credits section.

Required notice (TMDB FAQ):
"This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB."

Current API Terms notice:
"This product uses TMDB and the TMDB APIs but is not endorsed, certified, or otherwise approved by TMDB."

Official guidance:
https://developer.themoviedb.org/docs/faq
https://www.themoviedb.org/api-terms-of-use
